{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:28:28+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ExoCross", "steam_appid": 773840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled within galaxy NGC 43324 lies the earth-like planet Proteus, the home of ExoCross! Take on a (literally) out-of-this-world racing challenge featuring wild off-road terrain, powerful open-wheel vehicles, slipstream-powered boosts, and unparalleled handling, and see if you can become the greatest off-road racer in the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4CPT physics:</strong> Fully-simulated chassis and suspension components and a soft-body tire model create realistic weight transfer and understeer/oversteer. Bring your rallying and off-road skills to Proteus and you’ll be rewarded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/6801d01f3f966284abb468418168918c.poster.avif?t=1726851754\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/6801d01f3f966284abb468418168918c.webm?t=1726851754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/6801d01f3f966284abb468418168918c.mp4?t=1726851754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slipstream and boosts:</strong> Put the power down in the right places to charge past your opponents, or slot in behind them to recharge your boost as quickly as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three unique cars:</strong> Take the wheel of three distinct cars, each more challenging and powerful than the last. Start off in the approachable Vulcan XC-1500, enhance your skills in the more powerful Orion XC-3000, and see if you’ve got what it takes to master the fire-breathing Titan XC-7000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/9442b334570c7c43a50e3f4a29e785db.avif?t=1726851754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras_big/9442b334570c7c43a50e3f4a29e785db.avif?t=1726851754 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of circuits:</strong> Do battle on 19 distinct track layouts—each raceable in both directions—across four unique zones. From desert-like sands to forest dirt, pavement, and even a track high above the ground, you’ve never seen racing like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Racing and Career Mode:</strong> Advance through six racing series, two per car, to establish yourself as the top driver in ExoCross, going into battle with challenging AI opponents in up to 10-race seasons. Just want to pick up and play? Pick any car and track combo you want and hit the track!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Take on 48 unique challenges across all four zones and showcase your top speed against a global leaderboard.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/39c19d50d8b140e940e745cd76e871ff.avif?t=1726851754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras_big/39c19d50d8b140e940e745cd76e871ff.avif?t=1726851754 width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online racing:</strong> Face off with global players in a mix of Challenges and circuit races, with player votes determining every car and track selection. When the community decides, will you have the skills to make the best of the rounds ahead?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled within galaxy NGC 43324 lies the earth-like planet Proteus, the home of ExoCross! Take on a (literally) out-of-this-world racing challenge featuring wild off-road terrain, powerful open-wheel vehicles, slipstream-powered boosts, and unparalleled handling, and see if you can become the greatest off-road racer in the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4CPT physics:</strong> Fully-simulated chassis and suspension components and a soft-body tire model create realistic weight transfer and understeer/oversteer. Bring your rallying and off-road skills to Proteus and you’ll be rewarded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/6801d01f3f966284abb468418168918c.poster.avif?t=1726851754\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/6801d01f3f966284abb468418168918c.webm?t=1726851754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/6801d01f3f966284abb468418168918c.mp4?t=1726851754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slipstream and boosts:</strong> Put the power down in the right places to charge past your opponents, or slot in behind them to recharge your boost as quickly as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three unique cars:</strong> Take the wheel of three distinct cars, each more challenging and powerful than the last. Start off in the approachable Vulcan XC-1500, enhance your skills in the more powerful Orion XC-3000, and see if you’ve got what it takes to master the fire-breathing Titan XC-7000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/9442b334570c7c43a50e3f4a29e785db.avif?t=1726851754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras_big/9442b334570c7c43a50e3f4a29e785db.avif?t=1726851754 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of circuits:</strong> Do battle on 19 distinct track layouts—each raceable in both directions—across four unique zones. From desert-like sands to forest dirt, pavement, and even a track high above the ground, you’ve never seen racing like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Racing and Career Mode:</strong> Advance through six racing series, two per car, to establish yourself as the top driver in ExoCross, going into battle with challenging AI opponents in up to 10-race seasons. Just want to pick up and play? Pick any car and track combo you want and hit the track!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Take on 48 unique challenges across all four zones and showcase your top speed against a global leaderboard.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras/39c19d50d8b140e940e745cd76e871ff.avif?t=1726851754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773840/extras_big/39c19d50d8b140e940e745cd76e871ff.avif?t=1726851754 width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online racing:</strong> Face off with global players in a mix of Challenges and circuit races, with player votes determining every car and track selection. When the community decides, will you 